+# First use in NovaFlow
 
-DS Bot is a persistent Bot team built on DeepSeek Harness (DSH). The desktop app includes a pinned DSH. The plugin uses the DSH installation where it is enabled. Teams, chats and memory are stored on the computer hosting DS Bot.
+1. Sign in to NovaFlow. In the standard sidebar, select **进入团队模式** above the account button.
+2. Use the round settings button in the lower-left corner. The first settings tour covers Overview, the default model for new Bots, team members, and appearance. Replay it from **概览 → 引导**.
